#: scenario5:scenario5_3278D5C0_A12F_4186_96D9_B185A12BE12D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cb0ded973cb6b9cf839c783fe8c8b263b4a9f55b4707a68416529b663a13b800
