msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_02A77B9B_FC1E_472A_A6ED_32B97CFF6F3E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Riding the moonlight’s current, his hand fell against my cheek.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫It was much colder "
"than I had expected,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫달빛에 이끌리듯이 ⟪k:1⟫미셸의 손이 내 뺨에 닿았다. ⟪k:2⟫그 손은 놀라우리만치 ⟪k:3⟫차가웠지만"
"――"

#: scenario5:scenario5_E05F5ED4_80BB_4F67_9BDF_F9C180B1D998
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cacc14b014d1ea647285499e2acf8efd1c20b87a70620fa2eb8c88ea1cc48612
