msgstr "⟪k:0⟫열기를 띤 내 뺨에는 ⟪k:1⟫몹시 편안했다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_03433850_C291_4A13_9D33_EB97118F6FA8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c659a37a1ca33041d5cade6ee6d15ca5217ec3e916af00651be9052d393b3bd6
#. default-sha256: 805d10311dac38e6d88fec982b7b9b614059c7e3c8ad1725f3062e137fc1b8d1
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_03433850_C291_4A13_9D33_EB97118F6FA8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫As we drew closer, I could feel the warmth emanating from his body, and I’m sure he could "
"feel mine. ⟪k:1⟫The beating of my heart too.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫His breathing stopped for a moment, then he "
"gulped."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫거리가 좁혀지자, ⟪k:1⟫공기에 실려 ⟪k:2⟫서로의 체온이 전해졌다. ⟪k:3⟫아마도 ⟪k:4⟫심장 소리까"
"지. ⟪k:5⟫미셸이 호흡을 멈추고, ⟪k:6⟫침을 삼키는 게 ⟪k:7⟫확연히 느껴졌다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_72D2410D_6DD9_449E_AB27_4AEBC7485B4F
