msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫솔직하게…… ⟪k:1⟫말해 주십시오. ⟪k:2⟫만약 ⟪k:3⟫가능하다면―― 그리 가정만 해도 됩니다. ⟪k:4⟫그 "
"사람을…… 저주하고 싶습니까."

#: scenario5:scenario5_40A4CAD5_9803_4131_9C9B_F403C9431437
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 744b37951e1290d65fa1ea5b132dd204d7287b466146c6dca5d7d2bd2212b5c2
#. default-sha256: 16c72bc2f76e93f2e99b4c466f324239550d11bd2aec35a63f018d1d7a1cc2bf
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_40A4CAD5_9803_4131_9C9B_F403C9431437"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫...No, I would not want that."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫…………아뇨. ⟪k:11⟫그건 ⟪k:12⟫바라지 않아요."

#: scenario5:scenario5_624A38E4_B8E8_4A96_8D5F_55C759B15018
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6f82884941c194516fc083f1e87a3086912fde1021e8f827e6ca9732d47baa4e
#. default-sha256: ed83afaa7adde714c2e3040d2afcdfc042b4bed9da3b916508fe886093d37468
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_624A38E4_B8E8_4A96_8D5F_55C759B15018"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫...Why not? ⟪k:1⟫You have every right to take revenge.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫For what that man did... "
"⟪k:4⟫he ⟪k:5⟫deserves⟪k:6⟫ punishment!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫………어째섭니까. ⟪k:1⟫당신은 복수를 이룰 권리가 있습니다. ⟪k:2⟫안 그렇습니까……, ⟪k:3⟫보복당해"
"도 싼 남자 아닙니까……!"

#: scenario5:scenario5_5C1270ED_BD5C_428B_81E0_586D7F55FFAE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1f7d301efec82926deb9ec77dd384f52d2565ae23b495bc14fa03763082c1267
#. default-sha256: 062f83eb77abfe97b59d8e0489fb652042dc504b5a13b22a03bf1e8092aafe1b
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_5C1270ED_BD5C_428B_81E0_586D7F55FFAE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He inflicted so much pain on you!⟪k:1⟫You’re still shaking, more than a year later!⟪k:2⟫And "
"you can just let him get away with it out of the goodness of your heart?!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그렇게까지 다쳤고, ⟪k:1⟫지금도 그렇게 떨면서! ⟪k:2⟫입 발린 소리나 하려는 겁니까……!?"

#: scenario5:scenario5_8E94E79F_2A1D_44E4_A18A_1F6E16E386F5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f0398bc357996cd767b6dd06f99c72523e01fb14778f12fc7f19ed2accf2e67c
#. default-sha256: c5a514bd10a2cca634f2e8064b869e4114d79170d54187e9bc31c59f37b89ca2
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_8E94E79F_2A1D_44E4_A18A_1F6E16E386F5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Hypothetically!⟪k:2⟫ If you wanted to curse him, I—!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫가정만 하는 겁니다! ⟪k:1⟫당신이 저주하고 싶다면 ⟪k:2⟫저는―――!"

#: scenario5:scenario5_00B4C34E_7151_4532_9C5B_7DD2F18BBA71
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5ff5bce91c86eb526dcae8a2b2b5b59fce3ec76d808947fb2f196d96a0f7d803
#. default-sha256: 811e0a2d6ee8714731202f833fb757cfc463d4cfc94affcfa663867a85ea0129
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_00B4C34E_7151_4532_9C5B_7DD2F18BBA71"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I wouldn’t do it even hypothetically.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫And not... ⟪k:3⟫out of the goodness of my "
"heart.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫I’m just a coward."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫가정하더라도 ⟪k:1⟫안 바라요. ⟪k:2⟫이건 ⟪k:3⟫딱히…… ⟪k:4⟫제 마음이 고와서 그런 게 아니에요. "
"⟪k:5⟫겁이 많아서 그런 거죠."

#: scenario5:scenario5_555E6BA8_85C3_4325_BCE8_F0242592924A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4893b3243338c9c5727d58bda818a9f794ddbe007427d6c97d1becc5dd035ece
#. default-sha256: 34e46b00fe890d187b0593f75a143afc391a61c934fd805ba6d853418fcbb4ec
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_555E6BA8_85C3_4325_BCE8_F0242592924A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫A... ⟪k:1⟫coward?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫…………그게 ⟪k:1⟫무슨……."

#: scenario5:scenario5_B81AFD1E_DF1C_4CB4_9526_D9EF5B378135
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 48f0c56b7a0685ed01615cc5321e862e91bb1d1ac4b4637c4fa1943f4552bb34
#. default-sha256: 4a7056568b67eb5d102344fd2200816864f48fec2f3c3659dfe51dad40309570
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_B81AFD1E_DF1C_4CB4_9526_D9EF5B378135"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫If curses ⟪k:1⟫were⟪k:2⟫ real, and he were to die by one,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫만약 ⟪k:1⟫저주란 게 진짜로 존재하고, ⟪k:2⟫그 저주로 그 사람이 죽었다 칠게요."

#: scenario5:scenario5_2C03D6B1_1EBA_4090_BF12_97222E38BB16
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e334525340fa68cd00b472b32720386ab1a58b9772eed771cd744555fc134fff
#. default-sha256: 15f9f7fc5199075c76017dabb5f564b98b5cdd42a05c53d54ba0bf07715ca2aa
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_2C03D6B1_1EBA_4090_BF12_97222E38BB16"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫then I would never, ⟪k:1⟫ever⟪k:2⟫ be able to forget.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫If my resentment for him took "
"his life,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그럼 저는 ⟪k:1⟫평생 ⟪k:2⟫이 상처를 못 잊을 거예요…….⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫제 원한으로 죽는다면――"

#: scenario5:scenario5_85FC680D_8E14_48B2_86A4_3B629B5E75F2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4cfbb247bc4002e76b191f106056a79952f4bfd70d7e1ae993e3a22275b1448f
#. default-sha256: 9ff66bcaab13c7f7435609939bf6180fc0ba3bf18591bc01072add74ccbaeac7
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_85FC680D_8E14_48B2_86A4_3B629B5E75F2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫that would mean he had damaged me so permanently I was never able to get past it."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫제가 그만큼 ⟪k:1⟫상처를 입었고―― 끝내 떨쳐 내지 못 했단 증거가 될 거 아니에요?"

#: scenario5:scenario5_9EED34B2_7659_48AF_BCF1_63E3BC12D403
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 916b3f50dd5ed98c34a7b1e8983be1869ded4c1778cb5bbb5fb1ea051a9605f0
#. default-sha256: 5d5e7fa3b76e686de6886efa7da5d22ca827d7092c7ffb90117e8d89333ed509
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_9EED34B2_7659_48AF_BCF1_63E3BC12D403"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I don’t want that.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I ⟪k:3⟫want⟪k:4⟫ to be able to forget."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫그건…… 싫어요. ⟪k:1⟫전 ⟪k:2⟫깔끔하게 잊고 싶어요. ⟪k:3⟫지금은 ⟪k:4⟫이렇게 떨고 있지만……."

#: scenario5:scenario5_5CC8AFD9_1813_4A01_8031_92E27EFF7280
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c1d3bc631c207d11c67aab6e2a39740c64332b246522b37906f69c3d3088ccfd
#. default-sha256: 05bee7491a7e5577ae668e1542fa5338de9ae00626f677688e54e1c0d70a92f7
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_5CC8AFD9_1813_4A01_8031_92E27EFF7280"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I’m still shaking now...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫but one day, I want to be able to proclaim,⟪k:3⟫proudly, "
"that it no longer has any control over me."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫이젠 아무렇지도 않다며 ⟪k:1⟫떳떳하게…… 굴고 싶어요."

#: scenario5:scenario5_189EF050_DBC6_4845_B1E2_D1B2EAA912AC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0f68a5a048f6eced56f49296564a0cce8489ee6a36dfcc6ae8860c05d227c751
#. default-sha256: 31b54adc12e8b28c98d65600e59c1d439b16301d3d9228e49b6b12fab27675af
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_189EF050_DBC6_4845_B1E2_D1B2EAA912AC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫…………."

#: scenario5:scenario5_502BA41C_AA95_42BB_826E_23C3721818E2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e715e7b45977ef97df6d7f789f433b8e4f50c4c51aa2dbc3bfe97863eb3463d0
#. default-sha256: a6f8c243f496d923b4ceba160970775b87a40a758d5f1c0732f85d49c088d9d1
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_502BA41C_AA95_42BB_826E_23C3721818E2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫But I appreciate the sentiment.⟪k:11⟫"
"⟪k:12⟫Setting aside your choice of method..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫그래도…… 기뻤어요. ⟪k:11⟫저주 같은 ⟪k:12⟫"
"무서운 단어를 썼지만――, ⟪k:13⟫그건 그만큼……"

#: scenario5:scenario5_EBDC2BF5_6E78_45FB_BA22_EBA0A010DB03
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9226fb04b7fde385549342fb4bc73595d6bfb4b7f4b1a10f4fa233d982707d7a
#. default-sha256: f0713cf2c709d76e5a2932bb5c8f36868510ef17c79d0512844c644ef901de6e
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_EBDC2BF5_6E78_45FB_BA22_EBA0A010DB03"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫you asked out of concern, and that’s more than enough for me."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫절…… ⟪k:1⟫생각해 주셔서 그런 거죠? ⟪k:2⟫그거면 ⟪k:3⟫충분해요……."

#: scenario5:scenario5_297134E5_8E5B_45E6_BE7F_EE96BEC739E1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 57ca5efba4162541c2beaf35dff2f2bbb46fe00bf1dcce998661cab5768cf8ef
#. default-sha256: f8e94ccf98a36b8608fd908ce7ce71261937e2ef3fcd5fa778906762d8e61139
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_297134E5_8E5B_45E6_BE7F_EE96BEC739E1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫A soft smile spread across her lips, but all it inspired in me was powerlessness."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫지젤은 미소 지었다. ⟪k:1⟫하지만 ⟪k:2⟫내 안에 깃든 것은 ⟪k:3⟫무력감이었다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_3A092EBD_F1E9_47E8_AFE9_5459AD2E4A21
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 37ec2dd98b0ddd2c54baa958de21d27350feb21f1f0cf97c923a60464ba05121
#. default-sha256: 2c27af708f256e7ac4215d16d549eec4241653b15b945249a5aa460362453f7b
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_3A092EBD_F1E9_47E8_AFE9_5459AD2E4A21"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫She was putting on an act. ⟪k:1⟫Was the sentiment really “more than enough”?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫저 미소가―― ⟪k:1⟫허세인 건 아닐까? ⟪k:2⟫충분하다고? ⟪k:3⟫진심으로 ⟪k:4⟫그렇게 여기는 걸까?"

#: scenario5:scenario5_033764A7_4DD9_4F33_B798_CC908375A9FE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d5b716d1fa62f7255c25561c5a0012a222485badb3e6ec5c90c5f8e468a04f6c
#. default-sha256: 0f5c14730d4c2c3eb374088d2537a6d39cc92e36e368c03878b844f618007582
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_033764A7_4DD9_4F33_B798_CC908375A9FE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Of course not. ⟪k:1⟫Not when she was still trembling so much.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫But what was I to do?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫거짓말이다. ⟪k:1⟫이토록 떨고 있는데 ⟪k:2⟫충분할 리가 없다. ⟪k:3⟫하지만 내가 뭐가 가능하단 말"
"인가?"

#: scenario5:scenario5_7630CDDD_D507_4DDC_9DE5_AB55970B9303
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3b0984b4719ab40e6d166fba1946b670d916129cd27b77ae0039e01aa9ae6544
#. default-sha256: 9ba7727cb6ec72f2a7d3e5e885c8fe728ba03add12bafc0627bdc79eaa755fa6
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_7630CDDD_D507_4DDC_9DE5_AB55970B9303"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫What was I—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫unable to leave this house and helpless against the will of the "
"Bollingers—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫to do?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫저택에서 나오지도 못 하고――⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫그 집안을 거스르지도 못 하는 내가…… ⟪k:3⟫뭐가 가능하단 "
"말인가?"

#: scenario5:scenario5_3248D2FD_049C_445F_88A2_65E1956C5FEA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 91fb2cdbfc24c00cb6db20b811cc72dc957112210a9815710c9ee32e481545f0
#. default-sha256: 824c32e066f14baa282a4380c5bcd72075d63a59ba2240f60210e6c293e3105a
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_3248D2FD_049C_445F_88A2_65E1956C5FEA"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I was incapable of assuaging her pain, wasn’t I?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫내 힘으로는 지젤의 부담을 ⟪k:1⟫덜지도 못 하는 것 아닌가?"

#: scenario5:scenario5_6A8E4156_6BDE_4791_8E65_71090127264B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b96c6e6bd3cfc5a0d109b828cfb7730ab0b9b5a5bf00fb34714e9d20b082274c
#. default-sha256: f2a5e50549eb5b2c8fa748683955d22f1ba6091c397bdafef3c5f3d95942af75
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_6A8E4156_6BDE_4791_8E65_71090127264B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I couldn’t do anything,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫결국――"

#: scenario5:scenario5_8BB3BF4C_732B_4C1D_953A_E9A1CEDC2122
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0a4c0548afdb26566f821aa7f4bd66a90b40120c9ea639bcc92cf244f2861593
#. default-sha256: 3eea66a016538be2056761b272019abf9765f5b6accfc2600c30977deb52857f
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_8BB3BF4C_732B_4C1D_953A_E9A1CEDC2122"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫could I?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫아무것도 못 하는 건가……?"

#: scenario5:scenario5_B942DD66_8C99_4968_87FD_1D3FFE9C1D1A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0f68a5a048f6eced56f49296564a0cce8489ee6a36dfcc6ae8860c05d227c751
