msgid "⟪k:0⟫(To stop running from the problem.)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫(도망칠 생각만 해선 안 돼……)"

#: scenario5:scenario5_9D783F62_A220_4689_9883_7BDFD92F5521
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
