#: scenario5:scenario5_FC19E80B_D448_4CA0_A7F4_6E69599A3ED9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2d1941c47693ee2f8bd33110b8ea15daa9b42a6e5990ab3f86187acabeeafc63
