msgid "⟪k:0⟫—and my bedchamber was enveloped in the sound of weeping."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫눈물의 기척만이 ⟪k:1⟫내 방을 차지했다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_232D359C_1C5A_4F53_8E21_FC2C227271B1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 345609f26e5ee1791ecc8325df1f47e2dfa9457f5649b9ef3fe16f056693f8e0
