msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_232D359C_1C5A_4F53_8E21_FC2C227271B1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She cried like a little child. ⟪k:1⟫The usually strong-willed, cheerful, optimistic Giselle "
"wailed from the depths of her soul."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫……지젤은 아이처럼 울었다. ⟪k:1⟫드세고 ⟪k:2⟫밝으며 ⟪k:3⟫긍정적인 지젤의 ⟪k:4⟫진심 어린 통곡이"
"었다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_318922A9_1AD9_493F_9FB0_08C884701BD6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: acbd4844598f9a791aab45066b0d4ae88d2a073bba9951a8c42a20e39eae7276
#. default-sha256: 47bdfd6a45715f5fca878d6c3767b8d46ccd7c25a1fbb33e3f1f70393eac47e4
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_318922A9_1AD9_493F_9FB0_08C884701BD6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫This past year, she had constantly been nudging me forward.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫It was always her "
"leading the way."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫나는 1년 동안―― 지젤에게 많은 힘을 받았다. ⟪k:1⟫내 손을 이끌어 주는 것은 ⟪k:2⟫언제나 ⟪k:3⟫지"
"젤이었다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_35161B2C_F485_4339_81D8_862AE6A519E7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: da02a223f9e0c0cb6b6f7507974ec3a91b6a94589ca775e22760486af07f2ea6
#. default-sha256: d0bcc6cc14ca94d3ce60901110670a053d80322e3dc3bbb54c3d03104663cf85
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_35161B2C_F485_4339_81D8_862AE6A519E7"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫There had, undoubtedly, been moments where she had wanted to cry like this but couldn’t."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫실은 지금처럼 ⟪k:1⟫울고 싶은 순간도 있었을 텐데.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫그렇기에, ⟪k:4⟫앞으로는――"

#: scenario5:scenario5_506EC652_7C5A_4E84_BD65_0891E536C4FC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e50b16ff98e63e6e969e733a23be57520a44c6f8f7513dcda0a22ee926decfe9
