msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_506EC652_7C5A_4E84_BD65_0891E536C4FC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫So, starting now, I was going to try and support her too."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……나도 ⟪k:1⟫지젤의 손을 이끌겠다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_C4C08CE0_0F08_4366_9844_C416D3DD103A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e5a8620d00cc328155f48898ae7339c74bb1a259fd5f7006b91cc96a3a29a3ae
