msgid "⟪k:0⟫I was sure I could do it. ⟪k:1⟫That I could create a place where she could find peace."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫그러니…… 반드시 ⟪k:1⟫가능할 것이다.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫이런 나라도 ⟪k:4⟫지젤이 편안하게 느낄 보금자리"
