#: scenario5:scenario5_18413335_389C_4B6A_9F67_09886BC5243B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dc469c104a44c916ff6dc7f0f083674efdafa01dbd32aabc66999a2452c7da0e
#. default-sha256: 41cd3b9988fc16dd43a93f3b7f50698f7ec89d7a969503f92bfd564af9cdae1c
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_18413335_389C_4B6A_9F67_09886BC5243B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Giselle didn’t stop crying until the sun had begun peeking over the horizon. ⟪k:2⟫I "
"had, as I said, not looked away, simply holding her in silence."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫……지젤은 아침이 다가올 때까지 ⟪k:2⟫울음을 그치지 않았다. ⟪k:3⟫나는 말한 대로 ⟪k:4⟫가만"
"히 ⟪k:5⟫지젤을 안고만 있었다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_D8E3B551_A107_4FDB_BBE9_7C0FA718D3A0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: de251f54f802e041152d6f6a0a8cc2dbfcc0fe72dae17f065b90cb5805cfa802
