msgid "⟪k:0⟫She had a decidedly not-childlike frame, but she seemed incredibly small in my arms."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫내 품 속의 지젤은 ⟪k:1⟫결코 아이처럼 몸이 작은 사람은⟪k:2⟫아니지만――, ⟪k:3⟫매우 작아 보였다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_A03A7B2C_7364_4B41_8287_221A338F3E28
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5b375e87aa9243da65e949439e8b5655c86e1e57e7f47f37401ea4b8a8122d74
