msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫We felt each other’s warmth through my clothes.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Between sniffles, Giselle said "
"softly,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫옷 너머로 서로의 온기를 확인하며――⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫지젤은 ⟪k:3⟫오열과 함께 ⟪k:4⟫내게 이 말을 했다."

