msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫전 ⟪k:9⟫당신이…… 상대라면……, ⟪k:10⟫아무 망설임 없이, "
"⟪k:11⟫진심 어린 기쁨과 함께――"

#: scenario5:scenario5_E23440DB_5BBB_4AFD_A39B_A63B8A3FD27A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 11215ac86f26144328ef1d729b76f79cc1961b6840a9535d3cdebe6d60f9eae5
