msgid "⟪k:0⟫but eventually... ⟪k:1⟫I want to be able to put my hands on you too..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫저도―― ⟪k:1⟫당신하고 직접 접하고 싶거든요……."

#: scenario5:scenario5_A788D038_7B16_484B_9D00_44B79A005CEE
