msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫이윽고 지젤은 ⟪k:8⟫울다 지쳐 ⟪k:9⟫잠들었다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_934FD507_AAA7_47A3_8424_20AB8D34696A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8b2112f4aa6e2465d08f79aeaf35c9df0d2ce9ab28d2f507ab7b672dd50ad162
