msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_934FD507_AAA7_47A3_8424_20AB8D34696A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I prayed, from the bottom of my heart,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그나마…… ⟪k:1⟫오늘 꾸는 꿈이 ⟪k:2⟫평온한 것이기를――"

